OL,3,GNEWSACalls for action over unadopted
OL,4,Aroads
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Hertfordshire county councillor has
OL,7,Fcalled on the Government to require
OL,8,Froads on all new housing developments
OL,9,Fto be built to "adoptable" standards.
OL,11,FCurrently unadopted roads must meet
OL,12,Fparticular design and construction
OL,13,Fstandards before they can be adopted by
OL,14,Fcouncils.
OL,16,FAt a development in Hatfield where
OL,17,Froads have remained unadopted for 20
OL,18,Fyears, councillors said residents are
OL,19,Fplagued by issues around maintenance
OL,20,Fand fly-tipping.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
