OL,3,GNEWSACalls for action over unadopted
OL,4,Aroads
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat councillor Paul
OL,7,FZukowskyj has written to the Secretary
OL,8,Fof State to call for a national common
OL,9,Fplanning requirement. However, a
OL,10,Fspokesperson for the Ministry of
OL,11,FHousing said local authorities were
OL,12,Fbest placed to make decisions on the
OL,13,Fmatter.
